{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>6 ways to 7</i>\u00a0 is a high-stakes roguelike twist on the classic dice game Craps! It combines the hard choices of a roguelike, with the push your luck gameplay of craps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? Hit the target score each round to progress through increasingly difficult levels. But the dice aren't your only weapon\u2014between rounds, visit the shop to buy powerful, rule-bending chips, game-breaking upgrades, and bizarre power-ups that twist the odds in your favor (or against you). Stack multipliers, manipulate rolls, and create wild combos as you push your luck to the limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outplay the house, build the ultimate dice-slinging strategy, and make it to the final level? Roll the dice and find out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005440/extras/64496c99483c5a7425fd673e72812bf0.avif?t=1761612435\" width=760 height=250 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic craps gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scaling difficulty to challenge experience roguelike players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 special\u00a0chips with\u00a0unique\u00a0abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 15 NPCs who will help or hinder your strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Special\u00a0dice\u00a0to\u00a0push\u00a0the\u00a0odds\u00a0in your\u00a0favor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addicting gameplay and tons of dopamine</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005440?t=1761612435","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4005440?t=1761612435","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005440/1bf126305127574b4dc4a1a268